# blueprintz_debugger.phases.pdl - the blueprintz DEBUGGER (pause / queue / step-event / step-cmd / abort / clear-queue) on a COMMON event played through the real
# play_event.sh, in a scratch house under /tmp (nothing live is touched). BOOK 08-roadmap/design-docs/BLUEPRINTZ-DESIGN.md section 12 + the 2026-11-02 audit.
# The caller entity <app>/ce_caller starts with qolq=35; the common event `bump` (trigger player-touch) has TWO Change Gold +10 commands, so one full run adds 20
# and a command step adds 10. `BPCTL | <command>` runs bp_ctl against the scratch house; its output is checked with SAY. Common events were NOT part of the original
# 23-case proof (BLUEPRINTZ-DESIGN.md 12.4 "Not done"): this file is the first to step them.
# Runner: ops/+x/playthrough_op.+x run play/phases/blueprintz_debugger.phases.pdl
GAME | game-dev-hq | game_dev_hq
EVENTS | yes
COMMON | yes

PHASE | p1_no_debugger | with no debug file Play behaves as it always did and creates no debugger state | debugger, gate
MKDIRROOT | common_events/bump/event_pkg/pages
MKDIRROOT | #.desktop
BPCE | bump | trigger | player-touch
EXIT | 0 | the-manager-made-page-1-with-its-trigger
BPCE | bump | append | change_gold | amount=10
EXIT | 0 | first-change-gold
BPCE | bump | append | change_gold | amount=10
EXIT | 0 | second-change-gold
PLAYCE | player-touch
EXIT | 0 | play-ran
HAS | ce_caller/inventory.txt | qolq=55 | gold-moved-35-to-55
NOFILEROOT | #.desktop/blueprintz_debug.txt | no-debug-file-was-created

PHASE | p2_pause_queues_step_event_runs | paused: Play queues the trigger and runs nothing; step-event runs it whole | debugger, pause, step-event
BPCTL | pause
EXIT | 0 | paused
PLAYCE | player-touch
EXIT | 0 | the-play-call-itself-succeeds
HAS | ce_caller/inventory.txt | qolq=55 | nothing-ran-gold-unchanged
BPCTL | status
SAY | queue_pending=1 | one-event-is-waiting
BPCTL | step-event
EXIT | 0 | step-event-ran-it
HAS | ce_caller/inventory.txt | qolq=75 | the-whole-event-ran-both-commands
BPCTL | status
SAY | queue_pending=0 | nothing-waiting-now
BPCTL | step-event
EXIT | 3 | an-empty-queue-is-exit-3-not-a-silent-success

PHASE | p3_clear_queue | clear-queue drops queued events WITHOUT running them; a later trigger queues again | debugger, clear-queue
PLAYCE | player-touch
PLAYCE | player-touch
BPCTL | status
SAY | queue_pending=2 | two-waiting
BPCTL | clear-queue
SAY | cleared 2 | cleared-two
BPCTL | status
SAY | queue_pending=0 | nothing-waiting
HAS | ce_caller/inventory.txt | qolq=75 | the-cleared-events-never-ran
PLAYCE | player-touch
BPCTL | status
SAY | queue_pending=1 | a-new-trigger-after-a-clear-queues-again
BPCTL | clear-queue
SAY | cleared 1 | and-clears

PHASE | p4_step_cmd | step-cmd runs ONE command at a time: gold 75 -> 85 -> 95, then the run ends and nothing is held | debugger, step-cmd
PLAYCE | player-touch
BPCTL | step-cmd
SAY | held at | the-run-is-held-at-its-first-instruction
HAS | ce_caller/inventory.txt | qolq=75 | nothing-ran-yet
BPCTL | step-cmd
HAS | ce_caller/inventory.txt | qolq=85 | first-change-gold-ran
BPCTL | step-cmd
HAS | ce_caller/inventory.txt | qolq=95 | second-change-gold-ran
BPCTL | step-cmd
BPCTL | status
SAY | vm_active=- | the-run-ended-nothing-is-held

PHASE | p5_abort | abort stops a held run: the commands that had not run stay un-run | debugger, abort
PLAYCE | player-touch
BPCTL | step-cmd
BPCTL | step-cmd
HAS | ce_caller/inventory.txt | qolq=105 | one-command-ran-before-the-abort
BPCTL | abort
EXIT | 0 | abort-accepted
SLEEP | 1500
BPCTL | status
SAY | vm_active=- | nothing-is-held-after-abort
HAS | ce_caller/inventory.txt | qolq=105 | the-second-command-never-ran
BPCTL | detach
EXIT | 0 | detached
NOFILEROOT | #.desktop/blueprintz_debug.txt | the-debug-file-is-gone-after-detach
